{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"17378","name":"Melia Vendome","description":"يتمتع هذا الفندق البوتيكي بموقع رائع بالقرب من العديد من المعالم السياحية والتاريخية في باريس. سيتمكن الضيوف من الوصول بسهولة إلى كنيسة La Madeleine وساحة Place de la Concorde. كما تقع العديد من أماكن التسوق والترفيه على مسافة قريبة. يمكن الوصول إلى أقرب محطة مترو سيرًا على الأقدام. وتقع محطة قطار Saint Lazare على بُعد حوالي 2 كم من الفندق. ويقع مطارا Orly و Charles de Gaulle على بُعد 20 إلى 40 دقيقة.","address":"Rue Cambon, 8","city":"PARIS","countryCode":"FR","postalCode":"75001","lat":48.866797,"lng":2.325791,"stars":4,"chain":"SOLME","giataCode":"54832","phone":"0033142124400","email":"reservations.melia.vendome@solmelia.com","website":"https://www.melia.com/en/hotels/france/paris/melia-vendome/index.html","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/017378/017378a_hb_a_029.jpg?20240530055301?20250413053224?20250702073232","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/017378/017378a_hb_a_019.jpg?20241216014537?20250413053224?20250702073232","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/017378/017378a_hb_a_027.jpg?20241216014537?20250413053224?20250702073233","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/017378/017378a_hb_a_028.jpg?20240530055258?20250413053224?20250702073232","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/017378/017378a_hb_a_030.jpg?20240818200216?20250413053225?20250702073233","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/017378/017378a_hb_a_031.jpg?20240818200218?20250413053224?20250702073232","category":"exterior","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/017378/017378a_hb_a_032.jpg?20240818200220?20250413053225?20250702073233","category":"exterior","order":6},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/017378/01